    ["“伟大母亲”，现已确认为▇▇▇▇的化身，繁衍与生育的象征，掌握生命孕育与血肉繁衍，占据▇▇▇▇权柄。信仰祂的组织包括▇▇母亲、玫瑰学派、原始月亮。\n向祂祈求会获得旺盛的繁衍能力，但会逐渐丧失理智，性情狂热，探求生命与灵性本质的禁忌，陷入对生育与繁衍的欲望……\n献祭的密契仪式需要大量的血肉与生命，过程伴随着极致的疯狂和混乱……\n廷根危机中，月亮仆从以献祭整座城市为代价，制造邪神子嗣降临的容器，带来毁灭性的灾难……"] = "\"Great Mother\", now confirmed to be an avatar of ▇▇▇▇, the symbol of reproduction and fertility, mastering the conception of life and the proliferation of flesh and blood, occupying the ▇▇▇▇ authority. Organizations that believe in Her include the ▇▇ Mother, the Rose School of Thought, and the Primordial Moon.\nPraying to Her will grant vigorous reproductive ability, but one will gradually lose their sanity, become fanatical, seek the taboos of life and the essence of spirituality, and fall into the desire for birth and reproduction...\nThe secret ritual of sacrifice requires a large amount of flesh, blood, and life, and the process is accompanied by extreme madness and chaos...\nDuring the Tingen crisis, the Moon Servant sacrificed the entire city as the price to create a vessel for the descent of the evil god's offspring, bringing about a devastating catastrophe...",
